## 5. Gap Analysis

### Identified Gaps

| Gap ID | Description | Severity | Recommendation |
|--------|-------------|----------|----------------|
| G1 | No execution guide for Phase 15 (Improvement) | Low | Add execution guide if complex |
| G2 | No execution guide for Phase 10-13 (Commercial) | Low | Add execution guides after pilot run |
| G3 | No fallback escalation path for skill unavailability | Low | Document fallback handling |
| G4 | No KB update frequency specified | Low | Add to Phase 16 documentation |

### Gap Severity Definitions

- **High:** Blocks playbook execution
- **Medium:** Impacts playbook effectiveness
- **Low:** Nice to have, not blocking

### Gap Resolution Status

| Gap | Resolved | Resolution |
|-----|----------|------------|
| G1 | No | Acceptable — Phase 15 is analysis, not complex execution |
| G2 | No | Acceptable — Commercial phases will be refined after pilot |
| G3 | Yes | Fallback handling documented in skills object |
| G4 | No | Acceptable — KB update frequency is run-dependent |

**Result:** All gaps are low severity and acceptable

